{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>He shall surely be put to death.</b> Meaning: ״מוֹת״ — by the hand of Heaven; ״יוּמָת״ — by the hand of man. And he was precise to say <b>whoever touches</b>, to say that even in a manner for which one is not executed for another man's wife under the laws of the children of Noah, he shall be executed for this — as we wrote regarding the matter of Sarah in parashat VaYera (Genesis 20:4)."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:43:29.184312884Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}